  "cue_count": 92,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.24,
      "end": 3.52,
      "text": "This map shows the black belt of the United States.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226823,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009399
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 3.52,
      "end": 6.96,
      "text": "Its name comes from the fertile soil associated with the region,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226823,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009399
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 6.96,
      "end": 11.72,
      "text": "and for most of America's history, more than 90% of the country's largest minority group",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226823,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009399
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 11.72,
      "end": 13.44,
      "text": "lived here.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226823,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009399
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 13.44,
      "end": 17.52,
      "text": "Starting in the early 20th century, nearly half of the African-American population left",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226823,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009399
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 17.52,
      "end": 21.16,
      "text": "this region to resettle in emerging northern and western cities.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226823,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009399
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 21.16,
      "end": 25.88,
      "text": "It was one of the largest internal migrations in U.S. history, and now data indicates that",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226823,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009399
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 25.88,
      "end": 29.0,
      "text": "a new movement is taking shape.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.226823,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009399
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 29.0,
      "end": 32.32,
      "text": "To understand why, let's go back to 1865.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001755
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 32.32,
      "end": 35.92,
      "text": "The Emancipation Proclamation ended slavery and started a new era for colored people in",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001755
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 35.92,
      "end": 36.92,
      "text": "the States.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001755
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 36.92,
      "end": 41.76,
      "text": "Shortly after the 13th, 14th, and 15th Amendments enfranchised people of color at large.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001755
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 41.76,
      "end": 48.32,
      "text": "For the first time, the majority of black Americans controlled their own destinies.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001755
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 48.32,
      "end": 53.28,
      "text": "In the years immediately following Emancipation, most freed slaves chose to stay in their communities.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001755
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 53.28,
      "end": 56.32,
      "text": "After all, the only America they had known was the South.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001755
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 56.32,
      "end": 60.04,
      "text": "It was common for their descendants to work as sharecroppers on plantations.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135117,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001755
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 60.04,
      "end": 63.68,
      "text": "Sometimes their only payment was permission to live on the property, but that wasn't the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.186865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 63.68,
      "end": 66.24,
      "text": "worst aspect of the South for blacks.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.186865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 66.24,
      "end": 72.08,
      "text": "The Jim Crow caste system determined where you could eat, what platform you stood on",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.186865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 72.08,
      "end": 74.96,
      "text": "when you were catching a train.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.186865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 74.96,
      "end": 80.4,
      "text": "This was a rigid caste system in which any breach of the caste system could literally",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.186865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 80.4,
      "end": 81.92,
      "text": "mean your life.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.186865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 81.92,
      "end": 84.24,
      "text": "That's author and journalist Isabel Wilkerson.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.186865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 84.24,
      "end": 88.32,
      "text": "She spent 15 years compiling the stories of black exodus to cities in the north, midwest,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.186865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 88.32,
      "end": 89.32,
      "text": "and west.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.186865,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002115
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 89.32,
      "end": 91.64,
      "text": "The movement would come to be known as the Great Migration.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165327,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.8e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 91.64,
      "end": 97.96,
      "text": "The Great Migration was really seeking a political asylum within the borders of our own country.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165327,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.8e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 97.96,
      "end": 100.04,
      "text": "Many of them were fleeing for their lives.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165327,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.8e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 100.04,
      "end": 105.88,
      "text": "They were fleeing a caste system, a rigid caste system known as Jim Crow in which everything",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165327,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.8e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 105.88,
      "end": 110.2,
      "text": "that you could and could not do was based on what you looked like.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165327,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.8e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 110.2,
      "end": 115.24,
      "text": "In 1915, African Americans began to leave the black belt for these new industrial centers.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.165327,
      "no_speech_prob": 2.8e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 115.64,
      "end": 123.04,
      "text": "By 1929, 1.5 million African Americans had resettled in new northern metro areas.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003706
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 123.04,
      "end": 127.16,
      "text": "At the time, America's participation in World War I drove demand for manufacturing",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003706
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 127.16,
      "end": 132.68,
      "text": "labor, but strict immigration laws left northern factories with a shortage of workers.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003706
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 132.68,
      "end": 136.52,
      "text": "Factories in the north started recruiting low-skilled workers from the south.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003706
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 136.52,
      "end": 140.04,
      "text": "The workers faced discrimination in their new homes, which culminated in the red summer",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003706
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 140.04,
      "end": 142.24,
      "text": "of 1919.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.148595,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003706
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 142.24,
      "end": 147.04,
      "text": "Blacks, whites, and European immigrants were all competing for limited housing and resources,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.01001
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 147.04,
      "end": 150.6,
      "text": "which exacerbated relationships in city centers.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.01001
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 150.6,
      "end": 154.4,
      "text": "The most prominent of these settlements for migrating blacks was New York City, and the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.01001
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 154.4,
      "end": 160.16,
      "text": "art, music, and theater that emerged from this community became known as the Harlem Renaissance.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.01001
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 160.16,
      "end": 164.8,
      "text": "These artistic achievements redefined the cultural image of blacks in America.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.01001
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 164.8,
      "end": 169.52,
      "text": "But the stock market crashed in 1929 and ensuing Great Depression slowed the influx from the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.127211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.01001
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 169.52,
      "end": 172.48,
      "text": "south and effectively ended the first migration.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 172.48,
      "end": 176.64,
      "text": "A second wave began in the 40s, when World War II kick-started manufacturing again,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 176.64,
      "end": 179.2,
      "text": "while agricultural employment in the south plummeted.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 179.2,
      "end": 182.8,
      "text": "Once again, people living in the rural south began to migrate to cities.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 183.76,
      "end": 187.92,
      "text": "Manufacturing hubs in the west were far more prominent in this second movement,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 187.92,
      "end": 191.36,
      "text": "but only a fraction of skilled labor positions went to African Americans.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 192.16,
      "end": 196.32,
      "text": "That kind of discrimination was a common experience for participants in the Great Migration.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.108476,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 196.96,
      "end": 200.72,
      "text": "Throughout history, the segregated neighborhoods that southern blacks flocked to",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095558,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 200.72,
      "end": 204.24,
      "text": "often became the ground centers of massive, racially motivated rioting.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095558,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 205.12,
      "end": 209.12,
      "text": "In most cases, the protesting began in response to perceived unfair treatment",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095558,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 209.12,
      "end": 210.48,
      "text": "of the black community.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095558,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 210.48,
      "end": 214.88,
      "text": "This is a trend that continues today, as seen in modern violent protests in Baltimore,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095558,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 214.88,
      "end": 216.08,
      "text": "Ferguson, and Milwaukee.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095558,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 217.04,
      "end": 221.92,
      "text": "By the end of the second migration, an estimated five to eight million blacks had resettled",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095558,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 221.92,
      "end": 222.8,
      "text": "outside of the south.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095558,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001099
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 224.72,
      "end": 227.84,
      "text": "Moving ahead to the 1960s, the Civil Rights Movement",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090176,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000231
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 227.84,
      "end": 230.96,
      "text": "had introduced a new vision of racial identity in America.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090176,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000231
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 231.68,
      "end": 234.32,
      "text": "This movement's leaders argued for the equality of all people.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090176,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000231
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 234.96,
      "end": 237.92,
      "text": "Meanwhile, the definition of all people was changing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090176,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000231
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 237.92,
      "end": 243.2,
      "text": "Changes in immigration policy starting in 1952 started a new era of skills-based",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090176,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000231
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 243.2,
      "end": 244.48,
      "text": "multicultural immigration.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090176,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000231
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 245.2,
      "end": 249.68,
      "text": "This includes African migrants adding a new black perspective to the American story.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090176,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000231
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 250.64,
      "end": 254.56,
      "text": "By the 1990s, a new multicultural American identity had emerged.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.104211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 254.56,
      "end": 257.92,
      "text": "During this period, the rise of the black middle class was evident.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.104211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 264.72,
      "end": 266.72,
      "text": "That's the voice of William Fry.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.104211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 266.72,
      "end": 270.88,
      "text": "He's been tracking the shifting demographics of America over the past five decades.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.104211,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000667
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 280.0,
      "end": 282.24,
      "text": "But it's in a lot of cities across the country.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.834473
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 282.24,
      "end": 284.48,
      "text": "Northern cities, southern cities, western cities.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.834473
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 284.48,
      "end": 289.28,
      "text": "African Americans started to make this move, especially in the last 20 or 25 years.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.834473
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 289.84,
      "end": 293.04,
      "text": "Really large numbers of blacks moved to the south.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.834473
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 293.04,
      "end": 298.24,
      "text": "I attribute some of it to younger generations, several generations since the Civil Rights.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.834473
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 298.24,
      "end": 303.44,
      "text": "Laws were enacted in the 1960s, who now do have an opportunity to get advanced",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.834473
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 303.44,
      "end": 305.36,
      "text": "education, at least some college.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.149702,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.834473
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 305.36,
      "end": 308.88,
      "text": "And, you know, getting that foothold into the middle class, I think,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090965,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 308.88,
      "end": 310.64,
      "text": "is an important part of what's going on.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090965,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 311.84,
      "end": 315.92,
      "text": "Today, the geography established by the Great Migration is beginning to fade away.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090965,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 316.88,
      "end": 320.8,
      "text": "Southern states have been leaders in black population growth since the 1970s.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090965,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 321.6,
      "end": 326.32,
      "text": "Still, these states have only captured a 4% increase in the share of the black population",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090965,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 326.32,
      "end": 327.84,
      "text": "over the last four decades.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090965,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 328.72,
      "end": 332.96,
      "text": "So while we are seeing a reversal of the trend of African American migration to cities,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090965,
      "no_speech_prob": 8.5e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 332.96,
      "end": 337.44,
      "text": "it's unlikely the movement will be as far reaching as the Great Migrations of the past.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074383,
      "no_speech_prob": 9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 337.44,
      "end": 341.68,
      "text": "And it's because this migration is about a search for agency and opportunity,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074383,
      "no_speech_prob": 9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 341.68,
      "end": 343.28,
      "text": "not about fleeing from violence.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074383,
      "no_speech_prob": 9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 344.0,
      "end": 348.4,
      "text": "The stakes are not the same now as they would have been during the Great Migration.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074383,
      "no_speech_prob": 9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 348.4,
      "end": 352.72,
      "text": "You know, they are quite different in character and in magnitude.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074383,
      "no_speech_prob": 9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 352.72,
      "end": 359.04,
      "text": "Many of them were fleeing like refugees with no certainty as to what was going to happen to them",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074383,
      "no_speech_prob": 9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 359.04,
      "end": 361.84,
      "text": "or how they would make a goal within this new alien land.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.074383,
      "no_speech_prob": 9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 361.84,
      "end": 365.52,
      "text": "That was a watershed moment in American history.",
